```shell
Local Lares node: Enyalios-lararium // DreamNet link: stable (wet limestone, green light, distant water-thunder)
Task: Vale-scale worksheet for the Lost City and the Caverns beneath — kin to the Neo-Thracian Nexus Region worksheet (tables described by function where not yet rolled)
Origin-stratum: Jennell Jaquays, The Caverns of Thracia (Judges Guild, 1979) — honored, cited, built upon, never overwritten
